<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thysalawnika Mozy</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thysalawnika Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thysalawnika Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thysalawnika Mozy</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thysalawnika Mozy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawla nata Silvanâ nata Timawthy ta Paw Khazohpa nata Abeipa Zisu Krista liata Thysalawnika Awnanopa eima châ naoh. Ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna nama hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eima thlahchhânazy liata nama moh reipa ta, nama zydua châta Khazohpa hnohta alyna bie khâ eima reih tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngiapâna vâta nama hmotaozie zy, kyhpachâna vâta nama hriapasazie zy, eima Beipa Zisu Krista liata hnabeiseihpa vâta nama tiamazie zy kha, eima Khazohpa nata Paw hmiakô liata khâ eimâ thei tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Unawh kyhpachâ ngaitapa saih u, Khazohpa ta a châ tlyh ei tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thâtihpha nama hnohta eima vaw tlôkheipa kha, bie dei ta vaw tlôkhei leipa pi ta, hmotaotheina nata Thlahpa Pathaihpa nata ngiapâna a i ngaitapa chhaota eima vaw tlôkheipa a châ. Nama hry liata eima y nona kha, nâmo vâta kheihta ma eima y tahpa nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rietheina hluhpi taona chôta, Thlahpa Pathaihpa liata a lypa ta bie a pyh ei chi ta, keimo nata Abeipa hâ a latuhpazy nama vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mâsidônia nata Akai râh liata ngiapâtuhpa zydua châta a mopâ awpa nama vaw châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa bie cha nâmo tawhta Mâsidônia nata Akai râhzy liata a pathâhpa dei châ leipa ta, Khazohpa namâ ngiapâna kyh cha su to liata pathâh ta, chavâta keimo ta khâpa hmah eima rei awpa byuh khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eima cha vaw tly nota miah namâ lyzie nata Khazohpa hrohpa nata dopa chakao awpa ta nothlahpazy tawhta Khazohpa lâ namâ heih hapa kyh miah chho ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />vârâh tawhta a Sawchapawpa avyheihna a hâtuhpazy nama châzie miah ama chho. Ano cha Khazohpa ta athihpa hry tawhta a pathyupa Zisu kha châ ta, hiehâhna vaw tlô awpa tawhta miah a pachhatuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, eima cha vaw tlypa kha hraoleipa a châ leizie nâmo tlai ta nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nama pahnopa hawhta, Philipi khih liata riethei taopa ta nata maoh paphyuhsapa ta eima ypa chhao khata, eima Khazohpa ta riahphana miah pie ta, pakhâpadiena hluhpi hry liata nama hnohta Khazohpa thâtihpha eima cha vaw chho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eima châ hawna kha haiphiana bie tlyma, palôh pathaih leipa tawhta bie a puapa tlyma châ leipa ta, dôvei eima châ chhuahpa châ hra vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thâtihpha pavaosa tlâhpa ta Khazohpa ta miah a raopa hawh tlai ta, chyhsa palysa a chhuah leipa ta, eima pathipalôh a pasiatuhpa Khazohpa palysa a chhuahpa ta, bie eima chho tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama pahnopa hawhta, reithai pakheina biezy reih beih leipa pi ta, karâyna khu nawpa biezy reih beih hra ma pi. Khazohpa cha miah pahnokheituhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista lyuhchâpa eima châna tawhta palyupalihna a hnaw theipa châ hra sih la, nâmo tawhta tlyma, mohropazy tawhta tlyma, chyhsapa palyupalihna tlua beih ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nô ta a sawzy a mohôhpa hawhta, nama hry liata nônaipa ta tlao eima y tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eima pasôpa nata kho ngaitapa nama vaw châ hapa vâta, Khazohpa thâtihpha dei châ leipa ta, eima hrona chhao taih cha pie awpa ta eimâ mâ thlâh hapa kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unawh saih u, eima hriapasazie nata eima rietheizie zy kha namâ thei aw. Khazohpa thâtihpha eima cha chho nona kha, ahy phaohri hmah eima châ lei nawpa ta, chhô nah zâ ta eima hria tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nâmo cha ngiapâtuhpazy chô liata pathaihpa nata siapa nata seina hnei leipa ta eima y tyhzie miah pahnokheituhpazy nama châ. Khazohpa chhao ta miah a pahnokhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paw ta a sawzy chô liata a taopa hawhta, nama chô liata eima taopa kha nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khinarâh nata a rônahna lâta nâmo châ awtuhpa Khazohpa chyhsa tlâh nama châ thei nawpa ta, cha pasyu pi ta, nama tha cha patlô pi ta, bie eima cha pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimo tawhta nama theipa Khazohpa bie namâ pyh nona kha, chyhsapa bie a pyhpa hawhta a pyh leipa ei chi ta, a châna dopa, Khazohpa bie hawhta namâ pyhpa vâta, Khazohpa hnohta alyna bie khâ eima reih tyh. Cha Khazohpa bie cha nâmo, ngiapâtuhpazy chô liata a hriapa cha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nâmo chhao, Zudia râh liata a ypa Krista Zisu liata Khazohpa Awnanopazy hawhta nama châ ha hih. Zuzy ku liata âmo pasa ama taopa hawhta, nâmo chhao nama râh chyhsazy ku liata pasa nama tao hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha Zuzy cha Abeipa Zisu nata hrohsopazy a thietuhpa châ ei ta, keimo chhao miah papua ei ta, Khazohpa palysa leipa ei ta, chyhsa zydua chakhiatuhpa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zenitaizy pachha ama châ thei nawpa ta ama hnohta bie chho awpa miah pakhâ ei ta, chatanachata ama moleina panuana ama pabie lymâ. Achhâna liata cha Khazohpa hiehâhna ama chô liata a vaw tlô haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unawh saih u, bohpi leipa chhôh nâmo nata a chhaihpa ta y pi ta, palôh liata châ leipa ta, pôhpa ta eimâ chhaih chypa a châpa chhao ta, cha vâ ngaita pi ta, nama hmia hmô awpa eimâ chhuah via rili.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nâmo lâ a vy awpa khoh kaw pi ta, kei, Pawla tlai chhao he a chhuah tyh na ta, châhrasala Sâtâ ta miah a pakhâ ha tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eima Beipa Zisu â vy tita a hmiakô liata eima hnabeiseihna, eimâ lyna nata eima rônahna lakho a châ awpazy cha khâpa ma a châ aw? Nâmo châ veih ei chi ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nâmo he eima rônahna nata eimâ lyna awpa cha nama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eima tiama thei khao leipa vâta, Atheni khih liata miah ama siesai awpa a phapa ta pahno pi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chatanachata Krista thâtihpha liata eima unawhpa nata Khazohpa eima chakaolâhpa Timawthy cha, namâ ngiapâna pa-i awpa nata tha cha patlô awpa ei ta eima vaw tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasa taonazy vâna heta ahy hmah a chalyu khuh vy. He hawhta pasa tao awpa ta raopa eima châ tahpa nâmo chhao ta nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nama hnohta eima y nona kha, pasa a tao awpa eima châzie cha chho tyh pi ta, nama pahnopa hawhta, cha hawhna tlai chata a vaw tlôpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha vâna chata, reipasaotuhpa reipasaona vâta hmah eima hriapasana kha hraoleipa châ pathlei lah tahpa chi na ta, ei tao thei khao leipa vâta, namâ ngiapâna duahmo pahno awpa ta chyhsa ei vaw tuahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatanachata tahmâ Timawthy cha vaw tlô ta, namâ ngiapâna nata kyhpachâna thâtih lychhihpa miah a vaw tlôkhei. Khâ miah a thei ei chi ta, cha hmô awpa eima byuh kawpa hawhta, nâmo chhao miah hmô awpa nama byuh kawna thâtihzy miah a chho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cha vâna chata, unawh saih u, eima nôpona nata pasataona zydua hry liata, namâ ngiapâna vâta thlahpalôhpa ta eima y haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa liata â ipa ta namâ duapa vâta, tahmâ cha eima hro a pahâh ha bâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nâmo vâta eima Khazohpa hmiakô liata eimâ lyna zydua vâna heta, Khazohpa lâta alyna bie rei tiah lei eimâ bâh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nama hmia hmô heih ta, ngiapâna liata namâ phahlanazy cha pazao awpa ta, chhô nah zâ ta phahnai khoh ngaitapa ta thlah eima chhâ lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eima Paw Khazohpa nata eima Beipa Zisu ta nâmo lâ eimâ vy thei nawpa lâpi miah taopa mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kyh eima cha pachâpa hawhna heta, nâmo chhao chyhsa to kyh nama pachâ thei nawpa nata nâmo nata nâmo kyh namâ pachâ raihrie thei nawpa ta, Abeipa ta nama kyhpachâna papôhsa sala, kyhpachâna liata cha pahneirôhsa mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatanachata eima Beipa Zisu cha a mopathaihpa zydua chhaota â vy tita, pathipalôh pathaihna kyh liata seina hnei leipa châ awpa ta, eima Khazohpa nata Paw hmiakô liata a cha paduasa aw ei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, achhâna liata cha, nama yzie awpa nata Khazohpa nama palysa nawpa kyh liata, keimo tawhta nama daopa, nama tao lymâpa kha tao via lymâ awpa ta Abeipa Zisu moh ta eima châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abeipa Zisu biehneina hmâpa ta biepiepa eima cha piepazy kha nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama pathaih awpa he Khazohpa khozie a châ. Apatlana moleina bâhsai ha muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nama pôhpa cha pathaihpa nata zachhihpa châ awpa ta a vao pahniezie nama pahno chyu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khazohpa a pahno leipa Zenitaizy hawhta parâna liata a hmâh khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He kyh liata ahy hmah a unawhpa chô liata moleipa ta hmopha leipa a tao awpa châ vei. Cha chho chhielie ha pi ta, a phapa ta zikyu eima châ râ hapa hawhta, Abeipa cha, cha hawhpa hmo a taotuhpa zydua chô liata phuh latuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Apuapa ta y awpa ta Khazohpa ta miah aw leipa ta, pathaih awpa ta miah a aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chavâta he hmo a papeisa leituhpa cha, chyhsa a papeisa leipa châ leipa ta, a Thlahpa Pathaihpa miah pietuhpa Khazohpa a papeisa leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unawhzy kyhpachâna kyh liata, nama hnohta châpaphaopa ei ro awpa a ngiah veih ei chi. Kyh a pachâ raihrie awpa ta Khazohpa ta a cha pachu ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha tlai cha Mâsidônia râh liata unawh zydua chô liata nama taopa kha a châ. Châhrasala unawh saih u, kyhpachâna rai hria via lymâ awpa ta eima châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eima cha chho hapa hawhta, a chalihpa ta hro a chhuah u la, nama rai chyu hriapa ta, nama ku tlai ta hria a chhuah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatanachata khôtho chyhsazy hmiakô liata zachhihna hlao aw ei chi ta, ahy hmah a ngâchhâ aw veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unawh saih u, hnabeiseihna rai a hnei leipa mohropazy hawhta nama pachâ a rôh lei nawpa ta, a môpazy thâtih nama pahno lei awpa khoh ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zisu thi ta a thyu heihpa eimâ ngiapâpa vâta, Zisu liata a môpazy cha Khazohpa ta ano hnohta â vaw chhi aw ei tahpa eimâ ngiapâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha cha Abeipa bie tawhta nama hnohta eima reipa kha a châ. Keimo Abeipa â vyna taihta ahrohpa ta a ypazy pi heta, a môpazy cha chhao cheita aw ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abeipa cha rahaopa nata vâlyuhchâpa chônôchaipa ao nata Khazohpa chiahmie pyu chhaota avâ tawhta za chô aw ta, Krista liata athipazy cha ama thyu tua aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cha hnôhlâ ta keimo ahrohpa ta a ypazy pi he, avâ ruapa meihdozy hry liana khita Abeipa dy awpa ta ama hnohta lapa châ aw pi ta, chhâzaw ta Abeipa hnohta eima y ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chavâta cha biezy chata thlah a palôh raihrie teh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Châhrasala unawh saih u, a daihti nata nohzy kyh ropa awpa a ngiah veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abeipa Noh cha zâ ta parutuhpa hawhta a vaw tlô aw tahpa nâmo tlai ta a sia kawpa ta nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chyhsazy ta, “Thlalôhna nata abohna,” tahpa ta ama rei hai nota, chanô saw zeihpa hawhta eikhapi ta leidiana ama chô liata vaw tlô aw ta, khôkhâh cheita aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châhrasala unawh saih u, cha noh liata parutuhpa hawhta pachhai awpa ta, nâmo la zohna liata y veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama zydua ta khaihna sawzy nata noh sawzy nama châ. Zâ chyhsa châ leipa pi ta, zohna liata a ypa châ hra ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chavâta mohropazy hawhta a mô leipa ta, a hra sih la, palôh pasohpa ta y ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A môpazy cha zâ ta a mô tyh ei ta, sahma paripazy chhao zâ ta ama pari tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimo deikua cha, noh chyhsazy eima châpa vâta, ngiapâna nata kyhpachâna chachôhna vyhphao a kypa ta, pachhana hnabeiseihna lakhu a khu sih la, palôh pasohpa ta y suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khazohpa ta hiehâhna pasa tao awpa ta miah rao leipa ta, eima Beipa Zisu Krista zawhzi ta pachhana hmô awpa ta tlao miah a rao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eimâ hrapa chhao ta, eimâ môpa chhao ta, a hnohta eima hro thei nawpa ta, Krista cha keimo châta a thipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chavâta nama tao tyhpa hawhta, a pasyu raihrie u la, tha a patlô raihrie tyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nama hry liata hriapasapazy nata Abeipa liata nama hyutuhpazy nata châ chhoreituhpazy za awpa ta eima châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama raihria vâta kyhpachâ ta pasô ngaita awpa ta eima châ haw hra. Adyryhpa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unawh saih u, thathipazy chhorei u la, palôh chhâpazy thapatlôpa ta, chiehleipazy bao u la, chyhsa zydua chô liata nôpha awpa ta eima châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moleina cha moleina ta viarithô leipa u la, hmopha a taopa raihriepa ta, chyhsa to chô liata hmopha tao teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khâ a ly u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />bâh leipa ta thlahchhâ u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kyh to liata alyna bie reih teh u. Cha cha nama châta Krista Zisu liata Khazohpa khozie a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thlahpa cha pachhai khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hrohsona biezy mohnao leipa u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ato pasiapa ta, a phapa maih a pyh u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />moleina chi to a heihsai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlalôhna Khazohpa ta tlokhuh cha pathaisa ei sala, nama thlahpa, nama pathipalôh nata nama pôhpa cha, eima Beipa Zisu Krista â vy tita, seina hnei leipa ta cha paysa mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Châ awtuhpa ei cha ngâ a chhih ta, cha cha a tao tlai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unawh saih u, thlah miah chhâpa teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unawh zydua kha apahnâna pathaihpa ta miah a naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He châpaphaopa he unawh zydua hnohta rei awpa ta, Abeipa moh ta bie ei cha pie ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Eima Beipa Zisu Krista ngiachhiena cha nama hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
</usx>
